print(json_data)
```
This program creates a list of three 8th century Chinese inventions, converts it to a JSON data type using the `json.dumps()` method, and then prints the JSON data to the console. The output will be:
```
["Compass", "Gunpowder", "Printing"]
``` 
Note that this is just an example list and there are many more inventions from 8th century China that could be included in the list. <|endoftext|>
