Beach Volleyball
Total number of team sports: 4
```
Note that the output only includes "Beach Volleyball" because it is the only team sport with more than two words in its name in the provided XML data set. If you modify the XML data set to include other team sports with more than two words in their names, the output will include those as well. <|endoftext|>
