<|user|>
What are some other easy appetizer ideas that I can make at home?
<|end|>
<|asst|>
Here are a few simple and delicious appetizer ideas that you can easily make at home:

1. Caprese skewers - skewer cherry tomatoes, fresh basil leaves, and mini mozzarella balls onto toothpicks or skewers. Drizzle balsamic glaze over the top for extra flavor.

2. Antipasto platter - arrange sliced deli meats such as salami and prosciutto, marinated artichoke hearts, olives, roasted red peppers, and fresh mozzarella cheese on a platter. Serve with crusty bread or crackers.

3. Baked brie - place a wheel of brie in a baking dish and bake until the cheese is melted and bubbly. Top with your choice of toppings such as honey, walnuts, or fig jam.

4. Bruschetta - toast slices of baguette and top with a mixture of diced tomatoes, garlic, basil, olive oil, and balsamic vinegar.

5. Deviled eggs - hard boil eggs, cut them in half, and remove the yolks. Mash the yolks with mayonnaise, mustard, salt, and pepper. Spoon the mixture back into the egg whites and top with paprika or chopped herbs.

6. Spinach and artichoke dip - mix together cream cheese, sour cream, spinach, artichoke hearts, Parmesan cheese, and garlic. Bake until hot and bubbly and serve with tortilla chips or pita bread.

These appetizers are sure to impress your guests and are easy enough to make for any occasion. <|endoftext|>
<|end|>


