9. How has our product/service helped your life or business?
10. Are there any additional features or services you would like to see from us?
11. How important is price when it comes to our product/service?
12. How would you compare our product/service to competitors?
13. What factors led you to choose our product/service over competitors?
14. Have you experienced any issues using our product/service?
15. How was your experience with our customer service team? <|endoftext|>
