The CsvHelper configuration options HeaderValidated and MissingFieldFound are set to null to ignore any header validation or missing field errors. This allows the code to handle CSV files with different column names or positions.
Note that the ProductPrice property is defined as decimal to handle currency values. <|endoftext|>
