As a detective, you have come across a social media post promoting a new movie, but the post is encrypted in JSON format. Can you use your Swift programming skills to decode the information and retrieve the movie's title, description, image URL, trailer URL, and release date? 
Here is the encrypted JSON format:
{
 "movie": {
 "title": "rOYALTY",
 "description": "In a world where everyone is fighting to be on top, who will come out as the ultimate royalty?",
 "image_url": "https://example.com/royalty.jpg",
 "trailer_url": "https://example.com/royalty_trailer.mp4",
 "release_date": "2022-05-27"
 }
}
Can you write the Swift code to decrypt the JSON and extract the movie's information? Remember, every detail is crucial in solving the case. Good luck, detective!
<|end|>
<|asst|>
Yes, I can help you with that. Here's the Swift code to decrypt the JSON and extract the movie's information:
```swift
// First, we need to get the JSON data from the post
let jsonData = """
{
 "movie": {
 "title": "rOYALTY",
 "description": "In a world where everyone is fighting to be on top, who will come out as the ultimate royalty?",
 "image_url": "https://example.com/royalty.jpg",
 "trailer_url": "https://example.com/royalty_trailer.mp4",
 "release_date": "2022-05-27"
 }
}
""".data(using: .utf8)!
// Then, we decode the JSON data into a dictionary
let jsonDict = try! JSONSerialization.jsonObject(with: jsonData, options: []) as! [String: Any]
// Finally, we extract the movie's information from the dictionary
let movieDict = jsonDict["movie"] as! [String: Any]
let title = movieDict["title"] as! String
let description = movieDict["description"] as! String
let imageUrl = movieDict[<|fim_suf|>] as! String
let trailerUrl = movieDict["trailer_url"] as! String
let releaseDate = movieDict["release_date"] as! String
// Print out the movie information
print("Title: (title)")
print("Description: (description)")
print("Image URL: (imageUrl)")
print("Trailer URL: (trailerUrl)")
print("Release Date: (releaseDate)")
```
This code will output the following:
```
Title: rOYALTY
Description: In a world where everyone is fighting to be on top, who will come out as the ultimate royalty?
Image URL: https://example.com/royalty.jpg
Trailer URL: https://example.com/royalty_trailer.mp4
Release Date: 2022-05-27
```
I hope this helps you solve the case, detective! <|endoftext|>
