<|asst|>
Here are a couple of recipes you can make with chicken, broccoli, and cheese:

1. Chicken and Broccoli Casserole: Preheat oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). In a large bowl, combine the chicken, broccoli and cheese. Pour into a 9x13 inch baking dish. Bake at 350 degrees F (175 degrees C) for 45 minutes, or until bubbly and lightly brown.

2. Cheesy Chicken and Broccoli Pasta: Cook pasta according to package instructions. In a large skillet, heat oil over medium heat. Add chicken and cook until no longer pink. Add broccoli and cook until tender. Stir in cheese until melted. Combine pasta and chicken mixture in a large bowl. Serve immediately. <|endoftext|>
<|end|>




