<|asst|>
The rapid growth in population has put a strain on Mumbai's infrastructure, including its transportation systems and housing. The government has been working on improving infrastructure and transportation, but it remains a challenging task. <|endoftext|>
<|end|>
<|user|>
What measures are being taken to improve the infrastructure?
<|end|>
<|asst|>
