Suppose we have a dataset of criminal activities that contains various types of crimes, along with their descriptions. Here is a sample dataset:
| Type of Crime | Description |
| --- | --- |
| Burglary | The defendant unlawfully entered the premises |
| Assault | The defendant intentionally caused bodily harm to another person |
| Fraud | The defendant deceived another person for financial gain |
Based on this dataset, what type of crime can be classified for the following description?
The defendant unlawfully entered the premises.
<|end|>
