| "To Autumn" | William Blake | ABAB CDCD EE | Iambic tetrameter | "the maturing sun" | "like a gleaner" | Personification |
| "Autumn Begins in Martins Ferry, Ohio" | James Wright | Free verse | N/A | "The season of returns" | N/A | Imagery, repetition |
