Welcome to the level "Lava Ruins"!

This level is set amidst ancient ruins that have been engulfed by fiery lava. Your task is to navigate through the ruins and reach the end of the level.

As you begin, you find yourself on a ledge overlooking a sea of lava. You must jump across floating platforms and dodge the flames of the lava to make your way forward. Watch out for lava creatures that pop up from the burning inferno!

Once you reach the other side, you find yourself in the heart of the ruins. Here, you will need to use your platforming skills to scale ancient walls and jump across crumbling pillars. Beware of ancient traps that shoot fireballs!

As you progress, you'll encounter puzzles that require you to manipulate machinery and uncover hidden switches. Solve these puzzles to open up new paths through the ruins.

At last, <|fim_mid|>you reach the final stretch of the level. The lava has risen<|fim_eom|>

<|fim_suf|>}'} <|endoftext|>
