4. Defined deltoids (15 letters)
5. Well-sculpted calves (18 letters)
Now that we have arranged the traits in ascending order based on the number of letters in their names, we can use this information to create an effective workout plan for your client. 
We can begin by focusing on exercises that target the legs, such as squats, lunges, and leg presses, to help your client achieve lean legs. Next, we can incorporate exercises that target the triceps, such as tricep dips and pushdowns, to help them achieve toned triceps.
Moving on, we can include exercises that target the jawline, such as chin-ups and jawline exercises, to help them achieve a chiseled jawline. We can then incorporate exercises that target the deltoids, such as lateral raises and overhead presses, to help them achieve defined deltoids.
