How can artificial intelligence be used in healthcare?
<|end|>
<|asst|>
Artificial intelligence (AI) has many potential applications in healthcare, from diagnosing diseases to developing new treatments. One area where AI has shown promise is in medical imaging, where it can help identify abnormalities in scans more accurately than human radiologists. AI can also be used to analyze electronic health records to identify patterns and risk factors for disease. Additionally, AI-powered chatbots can help patients get information and schedule appointments more easily. <|endoftext|>
