line2.shuffle!
line3.shuffle!
# Print the haiku
puts "#{line1[0].capitalize} #{line2[0]} n#{line3[0]} n#{line2[1]} #{line1[1]}."
```
This code defines three arrays, one for each line of the haiku. Each array contains several words that can be used to generate a line. The code then shuffles each array to generate a randomized haiku, and finally prints the haiku using string interpolation. <|endoftext|>
