<|asst|>
To rewrite a sentence in the present perfect tense with two adverbs and two prepositional phrases, follow this format: 
[Subject] + [has/have] + [past participle verb] + [adverb] + [prepositional phrase] + [conjunction] + [adverb] + [prepositional phrase]. 
For example: 
Original sentence: She ate breakfast this morning. 
