Enhance your coding skills by correcting the syntax errors in the given code. Utilize your knowledge of Python to debug the code provided below. The code aims to sum the squares of a given set of numbers. Make sure that the function 'sum_squares' correctly takes in an integer input 'num' and returns the correct sum of squares. Don't forget to check for any issues with the 'for' loop syntax and the use of variables.
