TEDx events are independently organized TED-like events that can occur anywhere in the world. They were first introduced in 2009 to give communities, <|fim_suf|>, and individuals the opportunity to stimulate dialogue and inspire change through TED's mission of "ideas worth spreading." Since then, thousands of TEDx events have been held across the globe, covering a wide range of topics and featuring an array of speakers. <|endoftext|>
