<|fim_suf|>, including personalized recommendations on social media and streaming platforms, fraud detection in banking and finance, virtual assistants like Siri and Alexa, and medical diagnoses. AI also has the potential to improve efficiency and productivity in industries such as manufacturing and transportation. <|endoftext|>
