2. Cheesy Chicken and Broccoli Pasta: You'll need chicken, broccoli, cheese, pasta, and garlic. Cook pasta according to package instructions. In a large skillet, cook chicken until no longer pink. Add broccoli and cook until tender. Stir in cheese and garlic. Add cooked pasta and stir until well combined. Enjoy your meal! <|endoftext|>
