| Alexander McQueen | Designer for Alexander McQueen | Known for his avant-garde designs and theatrical runway shows that pushed the boundaries of fashion |
| Ralph Lauren | Founder and CEO of Ralph Lauren Corporation | Created a lifestyle brand that embodies American style and luxury |
