<|end|>
<|asst|>
To find the winning percentage of the soccer team for the season, we need to divide the number of games won by the total number of games played, and then multiply by 100 to get the percentage.
So, the winning percentage for the season would be (22 / 38) x 100 = 57.89%.
Therefore, the winning percentage of the soccer team for the season was 57.89%. <|endoftext|>
