<|user|>
How can I use SQL code to retrieve the names of the last three Presidents of the United States of America from the government website database and display them on the screen? Assume the government website database has a table named "presidents" with columns "name" and "term_end_date" and the data is sorted by the most recent term_end_date.
<|end|>
<|asst|>
Here is an example SQL query that retrieves the names of the last three Presidents of the United States of America from the "presidents" table and displays them on the screen:
```
SELECT name
FROM presidents
ORDER BY term_end_date DESC
LIMIT 3;
```
This query selects the "name" column from the "presidents" table, <|fim_mid|>orders the results by the "term_end_date" column in descending order (most recent first)<|fim_eom|>

