Can you classify this sentence based on the parts of speech and the underlying grammatical structure it employs? For instance, can you determine the tense, aspect, and voice of the verb "running," and the function of the preposition "to"? Additionally, can you identify any other syntactic or semantic features of the sentence that may contribute to its meaning or interpretation?
