[Excel Table]:
| Product | Sales |
|---------|-------|
| A | 500 |
| B | 300 |
| C | 200 |
| D | 150 |
| E | 100 |
[Excel Code]:
=INDEX(A2:A6, RANK(E2, B2:B6, 1))
The criteria are: 
- The report must contain data from only three random products
- The total sales of the selected products must be greater than 500
- The products must be selected randomly
How can I modify the Excel code to generate such a report?
<|end|>
