You can modify the Excel code by using the following formula:
=IF(SUMPRODUCT((B2:B6)*(C2:C6>0))<500,"",INDEX(A2:A6, SMALL(IF(C2:C6>0, ROW(C2:<|fim_mid|>C6)-ROW(C2)+1)<|fim_eom|>

