<|fim_suf|>, and how can we retrieve relevant data using XML? Consider the following points:
1. Plant-based diets are rich in nutrients such as fiber, vitamins, and minerals, which can support overall health and wellness. How can we retrieve nutrient data from an XML file containing information on plant-based foods?
