<|asst|>
In the heart of the forest, tall and green,
Where sunlight filters through the leaves above,
A maiden wanders, lost in thought and dream,
Her heart consumed by longing for her love.
The birdsong and the rustling of the trees,
Are lost to her, as she walks on alone,
