<|end|>
<|asst|>
Sure, here's the Python program:
```python
text = "fox vegetable orange carrot"
words = text.split()
sorted_words = sorted(words)
sorted_text = " ".join(sorted_words)
print(sorted_text)
```
The output of the program will be:
```
carrot fox orange vegetable
```
This is because the words in the input text have been rearranged in alphabetical order. <|endoftext|>
